elementor-element elementor-element-900daea elementor-widget__width-auto elementor-widget elementor-widget-xs-button\" data-id=\"900daea\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"xs-button.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"#datasheet\" target=\"_self\" class=\"xs-btn btn btn-primary\">\r\n\t\t\t<span class=\"xs-button-icon xs-align-icon-left\" ><i class=\"fa fa-download\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><\/i><\/span>\r\n\t\t\t<span class=\"xs-button-text\">Download Datasheet<\/span>\r\n\t\t<\/a>\r\n        \t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/section>\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-374666e elementor-section-full_width elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default\" data-id=\"374666e\" data-element_type=\"section\" data-e-type=\"section\" data-settings=\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-background-overlay\"><\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-100 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-e36edd7\" data-id=\"e36edd7\" data-element_type=\"column\" data-e-type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-00370d2 elementor-widget elementor-widget-xs-heading\" data-id=\"00370d2\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"xs-heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"xs-heading\">\r\n            <h3 class=\"heading-sub-title\">AIR-AP530<\/h3>\r\n                <h2 class=\"heading-title\">PRODUCT <span>OVERVIEW<\/span><\/h2>\r\n    <\/div>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-5b0120e product-des elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"5b0120e\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"tab_content\"><div class=\"content_row row container-inner vc_row wpb_row vc_row-fluid default-style default\"><div class=\"content_row_wrapper \"><div class=\"vc_col-sm-12 wpb_column vc_column_container\"><div class=\"wpb_wrapper\"><div class=\"rt_heading_wrapper \"><h4 class=\"rt_heading \">What This Product Does:-<\/h4><p>AIR-AP530 is an 11ax Wi-Fi standard Qualcomm Chipset high power industrial Ceiling Wireless Access Point support MU-MIMO, Wave2.0, OFDMA and Seamless Roaming.<\/p><p>It complies with 802.11ax, 4*4 MIMO technology, dual band, up to 3657Mbps data rate; equipped with 2.5G WAN & LAN ports, support MU- MIMO and DL\/UL-OFDMA modulation, faster Ethernet data rate and more users, multiple users can upload or download multiple packets at the same time, narrower subcarrier spacing and longer symbol time, improved stability and data processing efficiency, can be used in high density access environment such as university campus, concert venue, gymnasium, etc.<\/p><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-130a424 product-des elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"130a424\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"tab_content\"><div class=\"content_row row container-inner vc_row wpb_row vc_row-fluid default-style default\"><div class=\"content_row_wrapper \"><div class=\"vc_col-sm-12 wpb_column vc_column_container\"><div class=\"wpb_wrapper\"><strong>Wireless data rate up to 1.8Gbps:-<\/strong><\/div><div class=\"wpb_wrapper\">802.11ax supports 1024QAM, long OFDM symbol, 160M bandwidth and 11ax 2\u00d72 MIMO technology, wireless data rate up to 1.8Gbps, meets with demand of high-speed applications such as VR\/AR, 4K or 8K stream media.<\/div><div>\u00a0<\/div><div><strong>2.5G Ethernet port:- <\/strong><\/div><div>Using 2.5Gbps Ethernet port, compared with Gigabit port, the speed is greatly improved, so wired interface is no longer a bottleneck of wireless transmission, and the wireless experience in high pedestrian density scenarios such as conference room, bar, office area, KTV is optimized.<\/div><div>\u00a0<\/div><\/div><div><strong>DL\/UL MU-MIMO:-<\/strong><br \/>802.11ax support both downlink MU-MIMO and uplink MU-MIMO. It can communicate with multiple end users at the same time, greatly improving the user\u2019s uplink transmission rate and the system\u2019s uplink and downlink capacity, improving the efficiency of multi-user concurrent scenarios, reducing the terminal application latency.<\/div><div>\u00a0<\/div><\/div><div><strong>TWT (Target Wake-up Time):-<\/strong><br \/>802.11ax support TWT, allowing devices to negotiate when need to wake up, send and receive data. In addition, wireless AP can group the device into different TWT cycles, increase sleep time, reduce the device competing after wake-up, and save the device power.<\/div><div>\u00a0<\/div><div><strong>Coverage Improvement:-<\/strong><br \/>802.11ax supports long OFDM symbol transmission mechanism and 2MHz narrowband transmission, effectively reduces the packet loss rate and noise interference, improves the reception sensitivity and increases the Wi-Fi coverage.<\/div><\/div><\/div>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/section>\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-7f033b7 elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default\" data-id=\"7f033